# --- Environment & Secrets ---
# This file should not be committed to version control.
# Assumes .env is in the coreii_bertopic/ directory.
.env

# --- Python ---
# Ignore Python cache files and compiled files.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Data & Models ---
# Ignore generated data and specific model directories from the topic modeling project.
# The `best_bertopic_model` is intentionally NOT ignored.
**/data/
**/archive/
**/models/evaluation_runs/
**/models/bertopic_model/

# --- IDE, OS, & Notebooks ---
# Ignore common editor, OS, and notebook checkpoint files.
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
